      "text_helper": "Section 15.3.13 \"Timer input XOR function\" in chapter 15 (General-purpose timers (TIM2 to TIM5)), RM0008 Rev 21, page 395.",
      "section_content": "The TI1S bit in the TIM1_CR2 register, allows the input filter of channel 1 to be connected to\nthe output of a XOR gate, combining the three input pins TIMx_CH1 to TIMx_CH3.\nThe XOR output can be used with all the timer input functions such as trigger or input\ncapture.\nAn example of this feature used to interface Hall sensors is given in Section14.3.18.",
